375 641 1693 (This section is an overview of the CP/M 3 operating system, with a description of the) 1693 SB
225 700 1826 (system components and how they relate to each other.   The section includes a discussion of) 1826 SB
225 760 1889 (memory configurations and supported hardware.  The last portion summarizes the creation of a) 1889 SB
225 819 1405 (customized version of the CP/M 3 Basic Input Output System \(BIOS\).) 1405 SB
