225 2039 843 (     1.4 Banked and Nonbanked Systems) 843 SB
32 0 0 50 50 0 0 1 45 /MSTT31c126 font
225 2158 1905 (          CP/M 3 is supplied in two versions:  one for hardware that supports banked memory, and) 1905 SB
225 2217 1801 (the other for hardware with a minimum of 32 kilobytes of memory.  The systems are called) 1801 SB
225 2276 468 (banked and nonbanked.) 468 SB
225 2394 1906 (          Digital Research supplies System Page Relocatable \(. SPR\) files for both a banked BDOS) 1906 SB
225 2454 1909 (and a nonbanked BDOS.  A sample banked BIOS is supplied for you to use as an example when) 1909 SB
225 2513 1321 (creating a customized BIOS for your set of hardware components.) 1321 SB
