225 2002 627 (        1.8 Customizing CP/M 3) 627 SB
32 0 0 50 50 0 0 1 45 /MSTT31c126 font
225 2120 1934 (             Digital Research supplies the BDOS files for a banked and a nonbanked version of CP/M) 1934 SB
225 2180 1840 (3. A system generation utility, GENCPM, is provided with CP/M 3 to create a version of the) 1840 SB
225 2239 1948 (operating system tailored to your hardware.  GENCPM combines the BDOS and your customized) 1948 SB
225 2298 1831 (BIOS files to create a CPM3.SYS file, which is loaded into memory at system start-up.  The) 1831 SB
225 2357 1851 (CPM3.SYS file contains the BDOS and BIOS system components and information indicating) 1851 SB
225 2416 782 (where these modules reside in memory.) 782 SB
1175 2890 50 (11) 50 SB
