225 1470 1877 (              You do not need to implement every function in the BIOS jump vector.  However, to) 1877 SB
225 1529 1946 (operate, the BDOS needs the BOOT, WBOOT, CONST, CONIN, CONOUT, HOME, SELDSK,) 1946 SB
225 1588 1932 (SETTRK, SETSEC, SETDMA, READ, WRITE, SECTRN, MULTIO, and FLUSH subroutines.) 1932 SB
225 1647 1746 (Implement SELMEM and SETBNK only in a banked environment.  You can implement) 1746 SB
225 1706 1838 (MULTIO, FLUSH, and TIME as returns with a zero in register A. DEVICE and some other) 1838 SB
225 1765 1915 (utilities use the remaining entry points, but it is not necessary to fully implement them in order to) 1915 SB
225 1825 609 (debug and develop the system.) 609 SB
