225 2061 657 (         2.2 System Control Block) 657 SB
32 0 0 50 50 0 0 1 45 /MSTT31c126 font
225 2180 1948 (              The System Control Block \(SCB\) is a data structure located in the BDOS.  The SCB is a) 1948 SB
225 2239 1690 (communications area referenced by the BDOS, the CCP, the BIOS, and other system) 1690 SB
225 2298 1887 (components.  The SCB contains system parameters and variables, some of which the BIOS can) 1887 SB
225 2357 1943 (reference.   The fields of the SCB are named, and definitions of these names are supplied as public) 1943 SB
225 2416 1808 (variable and subroutine names in the SCB.ASM file contained on the distribution disk.  See) 1808 SB
225 2475 1142 (Section 3.1 for a discussion of the System Control Block.) 1142 SB
