225 1916 938 (                   Device                    Characteristics) 938 SB
225 2035 665 (              CONIN, CONOUT       ) 665 SB
975 2035 1059 (T h e interactive console that communicates with the ) 1059 SB
975 2094 1134 (operator, accessed by CONST, CONIN, CONOUT, and ) 1134 SB
975 2153 1153 (CONOUTST.  Typically, the CONSOLE is a device such ) 1153 SB
975 2212 1195 (as a CRT or teletype, interfaced serially, but it can also be a ) 1195 SB
825 2271 1182 (memory-mapped video display and keyboard.  The console ) 1182 SB
675 2331 784 (is an input device and an output device.) 784 SB
