225 227 1897 (              The time of day is kept as four fields. @DATE is a binary word containing the number) 1897 SB
225 286 1938 (of days since 31 December 1977.  The bytes @HOUR, @MIN, and @SEC in the System Control) 1938 SB
225 345 1684 (Block contain the hour, minute, and second in Binary Coded Decimal \(BCD\) format.) 1684 SB
