225 582 1831 (              This section contains a detailed description of the CP/M 3 BIOS    The section first) 1831 SB
225 641 1886 (discusses the BIOS data structures and their relationships, including the System Control Block,) 1886 SB
225 700 1940 (the drive table, the Disk Parameter Header, the Disk Parameter Block, the Buffer Control Blocks,) 1940 SB
225 760 1922 (and the character I/O table.  The overview of the data structures is followed by a summary of the) 1922 SB
225 819 1937 (functions in the BIOS jump vector.  A detailed description of the entry values and returned values) 1937 SB
225 878 1850 (for each jump instruction in the BIOS jump vector follows the summary.  The last part of this) 1850 SB
225 937 1777 (section discusses the steps to follow when assembling and linking your customized BIOS.) 1777 SB
