225 2239 13 ( ) 13 SB
525 2239 1530 (If @RESEL is equal to OFFH then @VINFO contains the address of a valid ) 1530 SB
525 2298 1601 (FCB.  If @RESEL is not equal to OFFH, then @VINFO is undefined.  You can ) 1601 SB
525 2357 1549 (use @VINFO to display the filespec when the BIOS intercepts a BDOS error.) 1549 SB
