225 2298 1923 (This only applies to double-density CP/M 1.4 systems, with disk sizes greater than 256K bytes.   ) 1923 SB
225 2357 1943 (It is preferable to copy double-density 1.4 disks to single-density, then reformat them and recreate) 1943 SB
