225 464 1809 (           PSH specifies the physical record shift factor, ranging from 0 to 5, corresponding to) 1809 SB
225 523 1886 (physical record sizes of 128, 256, 512, 1K, 2K, or 4K bytes.     It is equal to the logarithm base) 1886 SB
225 582 1949 (two of the physical record size divided by 128, or LOG2\(sector-size/128\).  See Table 3-7 for PSH) 1949 SB
