225 2298 713 (                  Entry Parameters: None) 713 SB
225 2416 1067 (                  Returned Values:    HL=address of Chrtbl) 1067 SB
225 2535 1869 (         The DEVTBL and DEVINI entry  points allow you to support device assignment with a) 1869 SB
225 2594 1919 (flexible, yet completely optional system.  It replaces the IOBYTE facility of CP/M 2.2. Note that) 1919 SB
225 2653 1056 (the CHRTBL must be in common in banked systems.) 1056 SB
