225 2002 1005 (                GENCPM [AUTO | AUTO DISPLAY}) 1005 SB
225 2120 280 (        Purpose:) 280 SB
225 2239 1911 (              GENCPM creates a memory image CPM3.SYS file, containing the CP/M 3 BDOS and) 1911 SB
225 2298 1821 (customized BIOS.  The GENCPM utility performs late resolution of intermodule references) 1821 SB
225 2357 1941 (between system modules.  GENCPM can accept its command input interactively from the console) 1941 SB
225 2416 609 (or from a file GENCPM.DAT.) 609 SB
225 2535 1872 (              In the nonbanked system, GENCPM creates a CPM3.SYS file from the BDOS3.SPR) 1872 SB
225 2594 1839 (and BIOS3.SPR files.  In the banked system, GENCPM creates the CPM3.SYS file from the) 1839 SB
225 2653 1901 (RESBDOS3.SPR, the BNKBDOS3.SPR and the BNKBIOS3.SPR files.  Remember to back up) 1901 SB
225 2712 1778 (your CPM3.SYS file before executing GENCPM, because GENCPM deletes any existing) 1778 SB
225 2771 980 (CPM3.SYS file before it generates a new system.) 980 SB
1175 2890 50 (87) 50 SB
EJ RS
