225 2180 1788 (CPM3.SYS file into memory to cold start the system.  CPMLDR contains the LDRBDOS) 1788 SB
225 2239 1511 (supplied by Digital Research, and must contain your customized LDRBIOS.) 1511 SB
225 2357 1903 (          The system tracks for CP/M 3 contain the customized Cold Start Loader, CPMLDR with) 1903 SB
225 2416 989 (the customized LDRBIOS, and possibly the CCP.) 989 SB
