225 523 1920 (             This section describes a sample debugging session for a nonbanked CP/M 3 BIOS.  You) 1920 SB
225 582 1888 (must create and debug your nonbanked system first, then bring up the banked system.       Note) 1888 SB
225 641 1804 (that your system probably displays addresses that differ from the addresses in the following) 1804 SB
