225 641 1915 (              If you are modifying an existing CP/M 2.2 BIOS, you must note the following changes.) 1915 SB
225 760 143 (           ) 143 SB
375 760 1794 (o The BIOS jump vector is expanded from 17 entry points in CP/M 2.2 to 33 entry points ) 1794 SB
225 819 1370 (    in CP/M 3. You must implement the necessary additional routines.) 1370 SB
225 937 1879 (           o  The Disk Parameter Header and Disk Parameter Block data structures are expanded.) 1879 SB
225 1055 1885 (              See Section 3 of this manual, "CP/M 3 BIOS Functional Specifications," for details of) 1885 SB
225 1115 1932 (the BIOS data structures and subroutines.  The following table shows all CP/M 3 BIOS functions) 1932 SB
